# Built binaries. Anchored with a leading slash so these match only the build
# output at the module root — an unanchored "homeos-core" also matches the
# directory cmd/homeos-core/, which silently excluded the entire main package.
/homeos-core
/homeos-core.exe
/homeos-release
/homeos-release.exe
/dist/
/.testbin/
*.test.exe
